     "e594307b-01b5-4e56-9e49-4d30b458697b"], Cell[
    "Circles are defined from congruence, not postulated.", "TableText",
     ExpressionUUID->"d31e0af8-6a6e-4076-9bf6-9b1e714c5133"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
